# Temporary Claude files
tmpclaude-*

# Agent / planning trees removed from version control (recreate locally if needed)
#
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/` on purpose: git does not descend into an excluded
# DIRECTORY, so a `!` negation beneath `.claude/` can never match. Excluding the CONTENTS
# keeps the directory traversable, which is what makes the negations below bite.
#
# The agent definitions and settings this project OWNS are tracked so they are IN THE COMMIT.
# `scripts/ci/validate-agents.js` reads the repository-local `.claude/agents/`. While these files
# were ignored they were absent from every commit, so a CI checkout had nothing to validate:
# whenever the old validator reached its missing-directory path it exited 0 having read nothing.
# It now exits 1 instead.
#
# Everything else under `.claude/` stays ignored, including `worktrees/` (agent checkouts
# of this same repo) and `settings.local.json` (machine-local overrides).
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/settings.json
.docs/
.journeys/
.planning/

